## Cursor prompt (paste into Flutter repo)

Implement **Admin System Notifications** for the CMS web app (`role: admin | superadmin`).

### Phase 1 — Inbox + polling (ship first)

Server is source of truth. No local Hive cache for operational alerts.

#### 1. API layer

**`lib/core/network/api_endpoints.dart`** — add:

```dart
static const String adminNotifications = '/admin/notifications';
static String adminNotificationRead(String id) => '/admin/notifications/$id/read';
static const String adminNotificationsReadAll = '/admin/notifications/read-all';
static const String adminNotificationsUnreadCount = '/admin/notifications/unread-count';
```

**`lib/features/admin_notifications/data/models/admin_notification_item.dart`**

```dart
class AdminNotificationItem {
  final String id;
  final String type; // NEW_ORDER | PAYMENT_SUCCESS | REFUND_REQUEST | REPLACEMENT_REQUEST
  final String title;
  final String body;
  final Map<String, dynamic>? data;
  final bool read;
  final DateTime createdAt;

  String? get orderId => data?['orderId'] as String?;
  String? get orderNumber => data?['orderNumber'] as String?;
  String? get contributionId => data?['contributionId'] as String?;
  String? get contributionNumber => data?['contributionNumber'] as String?;
  String? get requestId => data?['requestId'] as String?;
  String? get requestNumber => data?['requestNumber'] as String?;

  factory AdminNotificationItem.fromJson(Map<String, dynamic> json);
}
```

**`lib/features/admin_notifications/data/admin_notifications_api.dart`**

- `list({ page, limit, unreadOnly, type })`
- `unreadCount()`
- `getById(id)`
- `markRead(id)`
- `markAllRead()`

Parse `response.data['data']` per backend shape. Map `DioException` → `AdminNotificationsException` (`status`, `message` from `response.data['message']`).

**`lib/features/admin_notifications/data/admin_notifications_repository.dart`**

Thin wrapper over API; return typed models + pagination tuple.

#### 2. Controller — `CmsAdminNotificationsController` (GetX)

Register in `initial_binding.dart` (lazy, fenix):

```dart
Get.lazyPut<CmsAdminNotificationsController>(
  () => CmsAdminNotificationsController(Get.find<AdminNotificationsRepository>()),
  fenix: true,
);
```

State:

- `notifications` — `RxList<AdminNotificationItem>`
- `unreadCount` — `RxInt`
- `page`, `totalPages`, `isLoading`, `isLoadingMore`, `error`
- `filterType` — `RxnString` (`null` | `NEW_ORDER` | …)
- `unreadOnly` — `RxBool`

Methods:

- `loadFirstPage()` / `loadNextPage()`
- `refreshUnreadCount()` → `GET unread-count`
- `setFilter(...)` → reload page 1
- `markReadAndOpen(AdminNotificationItem item)` — POST read, decrement badge, navigate
- `markAllRead()`

**Polling:** while `CmsShellPage` mounted, `Timer.periodic(60s)` → `refreshUnreadCount()`. Also call on tab focus and `AppLifecycleState.resumed`.

#### 3. UI — `CmsAdminNotificationsContent`

Path: `lib/features/admin_notifications/presentation/contents/cms_admin_notifications_content.dart`

Match styling of `cms_notifications_content.dart` (navy `0xFF1A2A4A`, cards, `intl` relative times).

- **Header:** title **Activity**, **Mark all read**, refresh icon.
- **Filter chips:** All | Unread | Orders | Donations | Refunds  
  - Orders → `type=NEW_ORDER`  
  - Donations → `type=PAYMENT_SUCCESS`  
  - Refunds → `type=REFUND_REQUEST` (include `REPLACEMENT_REQUEST` in same chip or separate)
- **List:** `RefreshIndicator`, infinite scroll, unread dot, type icon.
- **Empty / error** states.
- **Tap row:** `markReadAndOpen`.

**Detail sheet** (`AdminNotificationDetailSheet`): full title/body/time, copy `orderNumber` / `contributionNumber` / `paystackReference`, primary CTA **View**.

#### 4. Navigation / deep links

**`app_routes.dart`**

```dart
static const String cmsActivity = '/cms/activity';
```

**`cms_route_paths.dart`**

```dart
static bool isActivitySection(String route) =>
    route.trim() == AppRoutes.cmsActivity;
```

**`cms_shell_page.dart`**

- Add `_NavIds.activity` (pick unused index, e.g. `17`).
- Sidebar: **Activity** with `Icons.notifications_active_outlined`, badge `Obx(() => ctrl.unreadCount)`.
- `_buildContent` → `CmsAdminNotificationsContent()`.
- Route map: `AppRoutes.cmsActivity` ↔ index.

**`markReadAndOpen` routing:**

```dart
void openFromNotification(AdminNotificationItem n) {
  switch (n.type) {
    case 'NEW_ORDER':
      final id = n.orderId;
      if (id != null && id.isNotEmpty) {
        CmsShellNavigation.selectTab(poojaKitOrdersIndex);
        updateCmsHashRoute(AppRoutes.cmsPoojaKitOrderPath(id));
      }
      break;
    case 'PAYMENT_SUCCESS':
      CmsShellNavigation.selectTab(donationsAllIndex);
      updateCmsHashRoute(AppRoutes.cmsDonationsAll);
      break;
    case 'REFUND_REQUEST':
    case 'REPLACEMENT_REQUEST':
      CmsShellNavigation.selectTab(poojaKitRefundsIndex);
      updateCmsHashRoute(AppRoutes.cmsPoojaKitRefunds);
      break;
  }
}
```

Reuse existing order-detail drill-down in `cms_pooja_kit_orders_content.dart` (same as hash `.../orders/:orderId`).

#### 5. Header bell (`cms_shell_page.dart`)

Replace static bell `Container` with:

```dart
Obx(() {
  final count = Get.isRegistered<CmsAdminNotificationsController>()
      ? Get.find<CmsAdminNotificationsController>().unreadCount.value
      : 0;
  return InkWell(
    onTap: () => /* open Activity tab or endDrawer */,
    child: Badge(
      isLabelVisible: count > 0,
      label: Text('$count'),
      child: Icon(Icons.notifications_outlined, ...),
    ),
  );
});
```

On CMS shell `initState`: `Get.find<CmsAdminNotificationsController>().refreshUnreadCount()`.

#### 6. Auth lifecycle

In `auth_controller.dart` after successful **admin** login (same place as `FcmBootstrap.registerWithBackend()`):

```dart
if (role is admin || superadmin) {
  unawaited(Get.find<FcmBootstrap>().registerWithBackend());
  if (Get.isRegistered<CmsAdminNotificationsController>()) {
    unawaited(Get.find<CmsAdminNotificationsController>().refreshUnreadCount());
  }
}
```

Logout: existing `unregisterFromBackend()` — unchanged.

