### Phase 2 — Web FCM push — **implemented**

Implemented in:

- `lib/core/notifications/fcm_bootstrap.dart` — `_registerWeb()`, `getToken(vapidKey:)`, `platform: web`
- `lib/core/notifications/admin_notification_router.dart` — foreground refresh + tap deep links
- `lib/core/notifications/push_router.dart` — delegates operational types to admin router
- `lib/core/services/notification_service.dart` — web FCM init path

| `data.type` | Tap navigates to |
|-------------|------------------|
| `NEW_ORDER` | Order detail (`orderId`) |
| `PAYMENT_SUCCESS` | `cmsDonationsAll` |
| `REFUND_REQUEST` | `cmsPoojaKitRefunds` |
| `REPLACEMENT_REQUEST` | `cmsPoojaKitRefunds` |

Use `data.notificationId` (Mongo inbox id) when present so `POST /admin/notifications/:id/read` succeeds on tap.

**Do not** route these types to the user mobile inbox when `AuthController.isAdmin` is true.

